#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:21
msgid ""
"Manage Federal Information Processing Standards (FIPS) 140 compliance "
"mode."
msgstr "Gérer le mode de conformité Federal Information Processing Standards (FIPS) 140."

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:23
msgid "**Check FIPS status:**"
msgstr "**Vérifier l'état FIPS :**"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:25
msgid "sudo hvmcli security fips status"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:29
msgid ""
"FIPS Status\n"
"───────────────────────────────────\n"
"  Kernel FIPS mode:    ❌ DISABLED\n"
"  FIPS kernel package: not installed\n"
"  GRUB fips=1:         not configured\n"
"\n"
"  Packages:\n"
"    ✗ ubuntu-fips — not-installed\n"
"    ✗ linux-fips — not-installed\n"
"    ✗ fips-initramfs — not-installed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:42
msgid "sudo hvmcli security fips status --json"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:46
msgid "**Enable FIPS mode (dry run):**"
msgstr "**Activer le mode FIPS (simulation) :**"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:48
msgid "Preview what changes would be made without applying them:"
msgstr "Prévisualiser les modifications qui seraient apportées sans les appliquer :"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:50
msgid "sudo hvmcli security fips enable --dry-run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:54
msgid "**Enable FIPS mode:**"
msgstr "**Activer le mode FIPS :**"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:56
msgid ""
"sudo hvmcli security fips enable --force\n"
"sudo hvmcli security fips enable --force --reboot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:61 ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:79
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "Options :"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:63 ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:81
msgid "``--force`` — Skip confirmation prompts"
msgstr "``--force`` — Ignorer les invites de confirmation"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:64
msgid ""
"``--reboot`` — Automatically reboot the node after enabling FIPS "
"(required for kernel-level FIPS activation)"
msgstr "``--reboot`` — Redémarrer automatiquement le nœud après l'activation de FIPS (requis pour l'activation FIPS au niveau du noyau)"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:65 ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:83
msgid "``--dry-run`` — Preview changes without applying"
msgstr "``--dry-run`` — Prévisualiser les modifications sans les appliquer"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:67
msgid "**Disable FIPS mode (dry run):**"
msgstr "**Désactiver le mode FIPS (simulation) :**"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:69
msgid "sudo hvmcli security fips disable --dry-run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:73
msgid "**Disable FIPS mode:**"
msgstr "**Désactiver le mode FIPS :**"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:75
msgid "sudo hvmcli security fips disable --force --reboot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:82
msgid "``--reboot`` — Automatically reboot after disabling FIPS"
msgstr "``--reboot`` — Redémarrer automatiquement après la désactivation de FIPS"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:85
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Important"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:85
msgid ""
"Enabling or disabling FIPS mode requires a reboot for the kernel FIPS "
"mode to take effect. Use ``--reboot`` to handle this automatically, or "
"plan a manual reboot."
msgstr "L'activation ou la désactivation du mode FIPS nécessite un redémarrage pour que le mode FIPS du noyau prenne effet. Utilisez ``--reboot`` pour gérer cela automatiquement, ou planifiez un redémarrage manuel."

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:87
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../tools/hvmcli/security.rst:87
msgid ""
"FIPS 140 mode enforces the use of FIPS-validated cryptographic modules "
"for all system-level encryption operations. This is required for "
"compliance with certain government and regulatory standards."
msgstr "Le mode FIPS 140 impose l'utilisation de modules cryptographiques validés FIPS pour toutes les opérations de chiffrement au niveau système. Ceci est requis pour la conformité à certaines normes gouvernementales et réglementaires."

